{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b09aa9dc5a833d8cc9","chatId":"6aa5a3cff5aa434986dabb1c8d1dd16e","sessionId":null,"userId":98431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2332,"promptTokens":1503,"completionTokens":198,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:12"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217391827618299,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b09aa9dc5a833d8cc8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482352164,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0b09aa9dc5a833d8cc8","chatId":"6aa5a3cff5aa434986dabb1c8d1dd16e","sessionId":null,"userId":98431,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n迈克尔一直在努力完善一个新魔术。他每天都在练习，想用自己的表演给最好的朋友莉莉一个惊喜。然而，莉莉一直偷偷地参加他的练习。当迈克尔决定为莉莉表演这个魔术时，她对魔术的每个部分都了如指掌。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，莉莉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 愧疚\nB) 激动\nC) 自豪\nD) 惊讶\nE) 感激\nF) 好奇\n\n## 问题 2\n莉莉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她预料到了魔术的所有部分，并乐于让迈克尔觉得她在事先一无所知的情况下就掌握了这项魔术\nB) 她热爱魔术\nC) 她并不对迈克尔的技能印象深刻\nD) 她为破坏迈克尔的魔术而感到难过","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005217391827618299,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b09aa9dc5a833d8cc9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482352161,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:12","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e589bbd5ffc94ee3a901b07c7a8674ba"}